A equals ninety nine, so P equals one
thousand over one plus ninety nine e to

113
00:08:44,494 --> 00:08:49,635
the negative point eight t. It spreads
fastest when five hundred know.

114
00:08:50,766 --> 00:08:57,064
Your turn. For d P d t equals point three
P times one minus P over two hundred, what

115
00:08:57,064 --> 00:09:01,113
